    <<set $Route_StampType = "名利">>
    <<jump C2_D146>>
-> 特技
    <<set $Route_StampType = "特技">>
    <<jump C2_D146>>
-> 事件
    <<set $Route_StampType = "事件">>
    <<jump C2_D146>>
===

title: ITC_Client1_SoulInput
